":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T16:09:51Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T16:09:51Z","body":"@attipaci @mattiaverga - can you confirm this request is no longer needed (or if it is)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2919889835/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2919999568","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2612#issuecomment-2919999568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2612","id":2919999568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86uC6hQ","user":{"login":"attipaci","id":17462471,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDYyNDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17462471?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci","html_url":"https://github.com/attipaci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/attipaci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-29T16:53:47Z","updated_at":"2025-05-29T17:55:07Z","body":"Hi @jlovejoy, \n\nI'm not sure I have the definitive answer to your question. I was originally trying to add the NAIF CSPICE toolkit to Fedora, because (a) my dumb understanding of their convoluted licensing terms was that it could be considered open-source, and (b) because I have also got the explicit permission of the NAIF manager to include it in the distribution (such permission was designed to exempt the toolkit from the remaining exemptions / restrictions of its standard licensing term). This is when Mattia suggested that it might not hurt to add the SPICE license to SPDX... That was then.\n\nHowever, once those with legal experience looked at the licensing terms, their reading was essentially that the SPICE license is not an open-source license, and no permission from the NAIF manager changes that. As such, there seems to be no way forward to include the toolkit in Fedora, and hence there is not real pressing need to represent the license in SPDX either. So, from my point of view we can close it.\n\nThanks,\n\n-- A.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2919999568/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimi